{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|7813CD664AD6F768C1D24CAB686DD163", "source_en": "\"The Apostate Hunts\". Perhaps our answers lie there.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "\"صيد المرتدين\". لعلّ إجاباتنا تكمن هناك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|794F411946E615E1571E07BA90C815EC", "source_en": "The Knight Gallant Alexander.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "الفارس قالانت ألكسندر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|79EA27DA48547988DDB00FA60F1B2100", "source_en": "Give me some time to study it.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "امنحني بعض الوقت لدراسته.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|79F5A3254E2775895FFAB9926A98819A", "source_en": "You're the one who survived the spire's Soul Siphon. Remarkable. What happened in Gildenarch, it's not natural. Some of the old texts would call it a sign. The dead gods stirring again... And now the Church speaks of these Abraxas Stones? Why not before? There is more to this story. Should you find anything of note, bring it here. You may prove useful. For a Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أنت من نجا من سحب الأرواح في البرج. أمرٌ لافت. ما حدث في قيلدنارك ليس طبيعياً؛ فبعض النصوص القديمة قد تصفه بأنه علامة. الآلهة الميتة تستيقظ من جديد... والآن تتحدث الجماعة عن أحجار أبراكساس هذه؟ لِمَ لم يفعلوا ذلك من قبل؟ ثمة ما هو أبعد من هذه القصة. إن وجدتَ أي شيء ذي أهمية، فاحضره إلى هنا. قد تكون مفيداً، بالنسبة لنيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|7BFAA1794DDC61AB202EFAB71C3B6FBD", "source_en": "A vampire's bite. Wonder if it's as romantic as the books say.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "عضةُ مصاص دماء. أتساءل إن كانت رومانسية كما تقول الكتب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|7C9225574BB7687FEA0703B602F5B40F", "source_en": "Go kill something, will you?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "اذهب واقتل شيئاً ما، ألا يمكنك فعل ذلك؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|81E06C9641A026865991649ECEEB3579", "source_en": "Yes?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "نعم؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|822F37E74533CF46623F61959507A81B", "source_en": "That you, child?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أأنتَ يا صبي؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|82A1C4CD4ACE22DE4CCBFE86CA32B9FD", "source_en": "\"The one to end the Lunitarian faith.\"", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "\"ذاك الذي سيضعُ أوزارَ الإيمانِ اللونيتاري.\"", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|82A760CB4F8BE33825863CB4E8E0D999", "source_en": "But Gallant being Gallant brought him to the Order.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ولكنَّ قالانت، كعادتهِ المعهودة، هو من أحضرهُ إلى الجماعة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|83167A6E43032503381FD8893A7638A9", "source_en": "Discover anything new?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هل كشفتَ عن شيءٍ جديد؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|83C1D6AF4B47B4C002DB988BA5743A90", "source_en": "Go on, then.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "استرسل، إذن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|850CDCCA4D5F78DAF3FCB7863186F5B4", "source_en": "So much for peace and quiet.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هكذا تتبدد السكينة والهدوء.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|8683160E414F7BCE25B1C38B8A993B6E", "source_en": "Hail, knight.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تحيةً لك، أيها الفارس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|888B02C741C9E8295FAB19AA31888007", "source_en": "And for the final bloom, they give themselves.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ومن أجل الإزهار الأخير، يضحون بأنفسهم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|88F1F74A4FE3A6E53FE38DA5B97A0C00", "source_en": "This is troubling... a dog-eared page.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هذا أمرٌ مقلق... صفحةٌ ذات زوايا مهترئة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|8BE06CE4415DD56049645BB80BCE2C1A", "source_en": "5162 in the collection. 0 in circulation. Splendid.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "5162 كتاباً في المجموعة. 0 في التداول. رائع.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|8E3CA5634EF7D68A4D0B739A312CA1EB", "source_en": "Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "نيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|8ECC53804791CA90304881B6F3FCAFED", "source_en": "Oh.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أوه.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|8F739B1A4A977BED00E8DA9FE20D684C", "source_en": "It was from there that the demon general prepared for war.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "من هناك، استعد جنرال الشياطين للحرب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|906E57694F5E4A55050FBB9A6455DB22", "source_en": "Oh. Dear, Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أوه. يا عزيزي، قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|911AFA8646ADD796D5CAD1BC724203D8", "source_en": "Greetings.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تحية طيبة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|91D2AE634A908DA1D37F718341BA42D1", "source_en": "The Church hunted him as a monster, though it played no small part in creating him.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "طاردته الجماعة كوحش، رغم أنها لعبت دوراً لا يستهان به في خلقه.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|93B236984FB8212E1CC53192BB74FD84", "source_en": "All three stones. And the spire stopped. Well done, Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "الأحجار الثلاثة جميعها. وقد توقف البرج. أحسنت صنعاً، يا نيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|964621314A8110BAEEC4D0878F05EB60", "source_en": "Come forward.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تقدم للأمام.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|97F63E714BDA4FEA772C238FF628D6EE", "source_en": "It seems even the divine may answer to something greater.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "يبدو أن حتى الإلهي قد يخضع لشيء أعظم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|98FAF5E046C34B0F3FB95FA1CD1776C4", "source_en": "Now only rot remains.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لم يبقَ سوى العفن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|999BCA304864CB66C795E9B24B3B9698", "source_en": "To war, dog.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "إلى الحرب، أيها الكلب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|99B2E25041DA90BC3926C282906D5357", "source_en": "Then it's true. E'frae, The Dry Rot King, is no more.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "إذن هذا صحيح. إفراي، ملك العفن الجاف، قد زال.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|99C2942349316818E06F24B34EF439B7", "source_en": "Valahk-Nor made it a place of sacrifice, experimentation, and summoning.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "جعلت ڤالاك-نور منها مكاناً للقرابين، والتجارب، والاستحضار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9B0AE93B41DEAFE7EAD82187B368CFC0", "source_en": "These letters tell a tale of madness in the Forsaken Streets.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تروي هذه الرسائل حكاية عن الجنون في الشوارع المهجورة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9B2222CF4A7F7FCCFC78599FD4BB67E1", "source_en": "The Church wanted him imprisoned.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أرادت الجماعة سجنه.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9B6F6C4A4AFE97730973D3A59525E8DA", "source_en": "Greetings.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تحية طيبة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9B87222241343F650C243B9A7A56FB3D", "source_en": "Approach, knight.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "اقترب، أيها الفارس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9BB830FA41C003F986CF91AF4094D90C", "source_en": "It tells of a figure destined to bring about the end of the Lunitarian faith.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "إنها تتحدث عن شخصية مقدر لها أن تسبب زوال إيمان اللونيتاري.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9BDBC16B44CE7D739A24B99F87470802", "source_en": "Oh good, you're here.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أوه، حسنًا، لقد وصلت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9DB23C804A778FA0D98456BD0684272B", "source_en": "Hail, Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أهلاً بك، أيها النيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9E40F5094F7FDCEEE48A30BA19E8C20C", "source_en": "Or, could there be a hidden meaning?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أو، هل يمكن أن يكون هناك معنى خفي؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9F61AC18451F34B47983EBB36EDD9BA7", "source_en": "But if true, I believe this is far from over.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ولكن إن كان هذا صحيحاً، فأنا أؤمن أن الأمر لم ينتهِ بعد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|9F88C302435E72315B3C0793E077635A", "source_en": "Knight.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيها الفارس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A08FBE0747B6897500FAC8B63287D6D5", "source_en": "The end times... fascinating", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أزمنة النهاية... أمرٌ مثير للاهتمام.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A1E9CEE949AE46E7536713A78957B659", "source_en": "The figure foretold to end the Lunitarian world order was never Gallant.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "إن الشخص الذي تنبأت به النبوءات لإنهاء نظام العالم اللونيتاري لم يكن قالانت أبداً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A26E3EED4B591EF661EA4FB2A522F502", "source_en": "That leaves one: Aegoroth, Eye of the Abyss, god of forbidden knowledge.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هذا يترك واحداً: إيقوروث، عين الهاوية، إله المعرفة المحرمة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A3311A9A4E914468F807F3B2A4199F01", "source_en": "You saw vampires!? To think what the world must be like beyond these walls. Hm? They killed you? Terribly sorry dear. Sorry indeed. If you need help with them, see the Blacksmith. He's one himself. Tell him I sent ye. Not that he likes me.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "رأيتَ مصاصي دماء؟! تخيل كيف يكون العالم وراء هذه الجدران. همم؟ لقد قتلوك؟ يؤسفني ذلك بشدة يا عزيزي. آسفة حقاً. إن كنت بحاجة لمساعدتهم، فراجع الحداد. إنه واحد منهم. أخبره أني أرسلتك. ليس لأنه يحبني، بالطبع.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A3343A434193517FA59751A8FA44CFD2", "source_en": "And turned a feral vampire into the finest blacksmith.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "وقد حوّل مصاص دماء وحشياً إلى أمهر حداد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A4763FE44EA0D9ADEE0F92BE044224BD", "source_en": "Knight. What is that you found?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيها الفارس. ما الذي وجدته؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A5076DE040E7E82DE29D36B3A81F6B75", "source_en": "The Godsreach Spire... who awaits us there?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "برج قودزريتش... من ينتظرنا هناك؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A5CEBA0B4222097B9611DA8F1E4E3D52", "source_en": "The Lunitarian faithful once fought a bitter war amongst themselves.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "خاض المؤمنون باللونيتاريين ذات يوم حرباً مريرة فيما بينهم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A7175EC34B92E1568557FE84E8791EDC", "source_en": "Nephilim, you're back.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيها النيفيليم، لقد عدت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A7C9F395483E699514084B8FD3099A1F", "source_en": "\"The Stricken Exegesis\".", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "\"تفسير الموبوء\".", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A8835E274EDB7B29087997A8234CEC3F", "source_en": "Gallant told me Solomon spoke to you. Impossible.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أخبرني قالانت أن سولومون قد تحدث إليك. هذا مستحيل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A92A5FAD4F5B09A245FDBD9C60CE2576", "source_en": "Hmm?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "همم؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A9A21BB84F081DD9AA429BA10C5FC5C9", "source_en": "The first Nephilim was nearly executed by the very Church he saved.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كاد النيفيليم الأول أن يُعدم على يد الكنيسة ذاتها التي أنقذها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|A9C109604EB77CE1D1A520AC90D491E7", "source_en": "The Lord of Perdition was once known as the God of War.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "كان سيّد الهلاك يُعرف فيما مضى بإله الحرب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|AA2312CB442D6B527E4E3391BEFB5DD5", "source_en": "Shouldn't you be in the field?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ألا ينبغي أن تكون في الميدان؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|ADD212C843356EE4F9CBE487DE05C4A1", "source_en": "I have a task for you, brute.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لدي مهمة لك، أيها الهمجي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|ADF67E41477129317019FEBC437F79D8", "source_en": "Good you have it! This will do. Hmmm. Hmmm. Yes alright this should suffice. Hurry get this to Gajov!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "جيد أنك أحضرتها! هذا سيفي بالغرض. هممم. هممم. نعم، حسناً، هذا يكفي. أسرع وأوصل هذا إلى قاجوف!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|AF64090E48C12C92B0D8FAA677829809", "source_en": "One in the Cathedral. One in the Crypt.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "واحد في الكاتدرائية. والآخر في السرداب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|AFACCAFC4A550A366B64B7BE43E39B0C", "source_en": "You bring more letters from Solomon Moore. This 'philanthropist' had his hands in everything, it seems. What was he really after?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لقد جلبت المزيد من رسائل سولومون مور. يبدو أن هذا \"المحب للخير\" كان يتدخل في كل شيء. ما الذي كان يسعى إليه حقاً؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|AFC56AD643691C3AFFB49E9F1C4A62FD", "source_en": "Yes, knight?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "نعم، أيها الفارس؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 25}}
